General

Management’s discussion and analysis of the financial condition at June 30, 2026 compared to December 31, 2025 and results of operations for the three and six months ended June 30, 2026 and 2025 is intended to assist in understanding the financial condition and results of operations of the Company. The information contained in this section should be read in conjunction with the unaudited financial statements and the notes thereto, appearing on Part I, Item 1 of this quarterly report on Form 10-Q.

